    },
    {
      "id": "m9dxeOIFZoiBsaUMKsHjN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 808.9395474159041,
      "y": 5143.697811067352,
      "width": 1210,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1018518735,
      "version": 460,
      "versionNonce": 1834920590,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785380844552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Summary ->\n    If we want to build a LLM powered application, lot of heavy lifting is done by LLM, but to run application\nend to end with all its moving components is a very very difficult task, specially due to technology is new\nso this thing becomes more difficult. This is where Langchain comes into the picture, it says work on only\nyour idea, this work I will do for you.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Summary ->\n    If we want to build a LLM powered application, lot of heavy lifting is done by LLM, but to run application\nend to end with all its moving components is a very very difficult task, specially due to technology is new\nso this thing becomes more difficult. This is where Langchain comes into the picture, it says work on only\nyour idea, this work I will do for you.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
