      "text": "1 concept of chain -> Here we can give form of chain to our diff diff task to perform a complex\n        task. In this chaing output of one component will become input of other component, we dont\n        need to do this manually. not only that we can form complex chains.\n        sequential chains\n        Parralel chains\n        Conditional chains\n\n2 Model Agnostic Development -> we can switch to AWS to GCP, or OpenAI to Google Gemini very quickly\n\n3 Complete Ecosystem -> Langchain tried to give complete ecosystem like if we need document loader,\n    each type of document loader is available. we can take data from cloud, we can load excel file\n    , pdf etc, lot of text splitters available, lot of embedding models are presnt etc\n\n4 Memory and State Handling ->  Here we can use in conversation memory",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 concept of chain -> Here we can give form of chain to our diff diff task to perform a complex\n        task. In this chaing output of one component will become input of other component, we dont\n        need to do this manually. not only that we can form complex chains.\n        sequential chains\n        Parralel chains\n        Conditional chains\n\n2 Model Agnostic Development -> we can switch to AWS to GCP, or OpenAI to Google Gemini very quickly\n\n3 Complete Ecosystem -> Langchain tried to give complete ecosystem like if we need document loader,\n    each type of document loader is available. we can take data from cloud, we can load excel file\n    , pdf etc, lot of text splitters available, lot of embedding models are presnt etc\n\n4 Memory and State Handling ->  Here we can use in conversation memory",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
