      "versionNonce": 1755569934,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785380844552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Conversational Chatbots -> with the help of this we can talk to more customers and resolve query.\n2 AI Knowledge Assistants -> It is chatbot but it is trained on our Private data also.\n3 AI Agents -> with the use of this we can't only talk, Agents can work also with the help of tools\n        like in Make my trip we can create Agent,that will going to create and book ticket for us\n        if someone ask to create ticket from here to here.\n\n4 Workflow Automation\n5 Summarization/Research Helpers -> we can create our own Chatgpt to work with private data.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 Conversational Chatbots -> with the help of this we can talk to more customers and resolve query.\n2 AI Knowledge Assistants -> It is chatbot but it is trained on our Private data also.\n3 AI Agents -> with the use of this we can't only talk, Agents can work also with the help of tools\n        like in Make my trip we can create Agent,that will going to create and book ticket for us\n        if someone ask to create ticket from here to here.\n\n4 Workflow Automation\n5 Summarization/Research Helpers -> we can create our own Chatgpt to work with private data.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
